estDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76120/Q7612001","priority":5,"questId":76120,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":761200101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2077353602,"text":"...Here. This is for you. That's my share done, yes?","nextNodeIds":[761200102]},{"nodeId":761200102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1363948138,"text":"Hey, it's a drawing canvas. Wait, that means...!","nextNodeIds":[761200103]},{"nodeId":761200103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1107567658,"text":"Ah. You're just in time.","nextNodeIds":[761200104]},{"nodeId":761200104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15702,"speakerName":"Maalaus","textMapHash":2791691594,"text":"~!","nextNodeIds":[761200105]},{"nodeId":761200105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":337469114,"text":"Well, if it isn't Maalaus, our Great Painter! Long time no see!","nextNodeIds":[761200106]},{"nodeId":761200106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3279770002,"text":"So, what are we \"just in time\" for?","nextNodeIds":[761200107]},{"nodeId":761200107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3715795626,"text":"I just took Maalaus to the moon for a bit.","nextNodeIds":[761200108]},{"nodeId":761200108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4065779898,"text":"Paimon's sooo jealous of how you just... said that, like you were visiting the garden next door or something.","nextNodeIds":[761200109]},{"nodeId":761200109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3429526994,"text":"Still, what did you go there for? Looking for inspiration?","nextNodeIds":[761200110]},{"nodeId":761200110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":969103930,"text":"That's half right. We also selected a location for an \"exhibition.\" Do you recall?","nextNodeIds":[761200111]},{"nodeId":761200111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4188741322,"text":"Paimon does! Maalaus's Moon Goddess exhibition! Don't forget to invite us when the time comes, okay?","nextNodeIds":[761200112]},{"nodeId":761200112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":321876642,"text":"Yes, of course. In addition, Maalaus seems to be able to sense subtle changes around her.","nextNodeIds":[761200113]},{"nodeId":761200113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3720532666,"text":"She's told me that I have changed a lot since returning from the moon.","nextNodeIds":[761200114]},{"nodeId":761200114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1781441202,"text":"That's why she wanted me to take her there, to see if there was something special about it.","nextNodeIds":[761200115]},{"nodeId":761200115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3100934002,"text":"Heh! Now that's an artist for you, alright...","nextNodeIds":[761200116]},{"nodeId":761200116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1129071506,"text":"So, this special thing...","nextNodeIds":[761200117]},{"nodeId":761200117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":4119981178,"text":"I'm not sure either. I took Maalaus to many places, but none of them satisfied her.","nextNodeIds":[761200118]},{"nodeId":761200118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2537552946,"text":"That is, until I brought her close to your ship.","nextNodeIds":[761200119,761200120]},{"nodeId":761200119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2573925586,"text":"Our spaceship?","nextNodeIds":[761200121]},{"nodeId":761200121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3640868258,"text":"But after bringing her closer, I found that she wasn't interested in the ship itself.","nextNodeIds":[761200122]},{"nodeId":761200122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":138916722,"text":"Huh? What does that mean?","nextNodeIds":[761200123]},{"nodeId":761200123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15702,"speakerName":"Maalaus","textMapHash":3620282138,"text":"!!!","nextNodeIds":[761200124]},{"nodeId":761200124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":599252442,"text":"Ohh, she's flying around you, Columbina.","nextNodeIds":[761200125]},{"nodeId":761200125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":964047706,"text":"Haha. She did so back then as well.","nextNodeIds":[761200126]},{"nodeId":761200126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2941570602,"text":"I suspect that her real interest lies with how I looked after seeing the spaceship.","nextNodeIds":[761200127]},{"nodeId":761200127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1355188546,"text":"How you... looked?","nextNodeIds":[761200128]},{"nodeId":761200128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1777446410,"text":"#Yes. I was reminded of when {NICKNAME} and I went there together.","nextNodeIds":[761200129]},{"nodeId":761200129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2382081834,"text":"#We sat atop the ship, gazing at Teyvat. {M#He}{F#She} found the truth about the past, and I found my \"home.\"","nextNodeIds":[761200130]},{"nodeId":761200130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":4199759866,"text":"Just thinking about it gave me a sense of peace... or perhaps, happiness.","nextNodeIds":[761200131]},{"nodeId":761200131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15702,"speakerName":"Maalaus","textMapHash":4128005210,"text":"~!","nextNodeIds":[761200132]},{"nodeId":761200132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":349591290,"text":"Yes, you are right. These are not things I would have felt before.","nextNodeIds":[761200133]},{"nodeId":761200133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2583649714,"text":"So, I told Maalaus our story, including what happened after we reached the moon.","nextNodeIds":[761200134]},{"nodeId":761200134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3043881474,"text":"She seemed most pleased after that, as if she had found the inspiration she so desired.","nextNodeIds":[761200135]},{"nodeId":761200135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2431389570,"text":"Ah. So now it's time for the great artist to work her magic, right?","nextNodeIds":[761200136]},{"nodeId":761200136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":322198706,"text":"Heh, you didn't take Paimon up there back then, so she's pretty curious what Maalaus is gonna paint too!","nextNodeIds":[761200137]},{"nodeId":761200137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2404159858,"text":"And what are we going to use as paint this time?","nextNodeIds":[761200138]},{"nodeId":761200138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":293715722,"text":"This time is something special.","nextNodeIds":[761200139]},{"nodeId":761200139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15702,"speakerName":"Maalaus","textMapHash":554168410,"text":"~!","nextNodeIds":[761200140]},{"nodeId":761200140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1409153362,"text":"Maalaus says she wants paints that belong only to us.","nextNodeIds":[761200141]},{"nodeId":761200141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2976571338,"text":"And... what does that mean?","nextNodeIds":[761200142]},{"nodeId":761200142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":604139498,"text":"I believe she means things that will remind you about this journey, what you have gained from it, and the joy it has brought you.","nextNodeIds":[761200143]},{"nodeId":761200143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":233149330,"text":"Don't worry. Maalaus just wants to see such objects and feel them. She wouldn't use anything so precious as paint.","nextNodeIds":[761200144]},{"nodeId":761200144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1001144082,"text":"What did you give her?","nextNodeIds":[761200145]},{"nodeId":761200145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3305930466,"text":"Soil from the moon, and the card you gave me for Moon-Prayer Night.","nextNodeIds":[761200146]},{"nodeId":761200146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4212699866,"text":"#Oh, so basically, it's gotta be something that represents this adventure, right? Okay then. {NICKNAME}, you pick!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":761200120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3225096282,"text":"Well, that's certainly quite special...","nextNodeIds":[761200121]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7612001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"e